---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const lastUpdated = "January 5, 2026";
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Mingle" description="Mingle's terms of service outline the rules and guidelines for using our dating app.">
  <Header />
  
  <main class="pt-24 pb-16 bg-[var(--color-dark)]">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <span class="inline-block px-4 py-2 bg-[var(--color-primary)]/20 text-[var(--color-primary-light)] rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-4 border border-[var(--color-primary)]/30">
          Legal
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
        <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-muted)]">
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p>
              By accessing or using Mingle ("the App"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service 
              ("Terms"). If you do not agree to these Terms, please do not use the App.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">2. Eligibility</h2>
            <p>To use Mingle, you must:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-4">
              <li>Be at least 18 years of age</li>
              <li>Be legally able to enter into a binding contract</li>
              <li>Not be prohibited from using the service under applicable law</li>
              <li>Not have been previously banned from the service</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">3. Account Registration</h2>
            <p>
              You agree to provide accurate, current, and complete information during registration and 
              to update such information to keep it accurate. You are responsible for maintaining the 
              confidentiality of your account credentials and for all activities under your account.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">4. User Conduct</h2>
            <p>You agree NOT to:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-4">
              <li>Use the App for any illegal purpose or in violation of any laws</li>
              <li>Harass, abuse, or harm other users</li>
              <li>Post false, misleading, or deceptive content</li>
              <li>Impersonate any person or entity</li>
              <li>Upload viruses or malicious code</li>
              <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the App or other users' accounts</li>
              <li>Use the App for commercial purposes without our consent</li>
              <li>Scrape or collect user data without permission</li>
              <li>Circumvent any security features of the App</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">5. Content Guidelines</h2>
            <p>
              You are solely responsible for the content you post. By posting content, you grant us a 
              non-exclusive, royalty-free license to use, display, and distribute that content within 
              the App.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">Content must NOT contain:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-4">
              <li>Nudity or sexually explicit material</li>
              <li>Violence or threats of violence</li>
              <li>Hate speech or discrimination</li>
              <li>Spam or commercial solicitation</li>
              <li>Copyrighted material you don't own</li>
              <li>Private information of others without consent</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">6. Safety</h2>
            <p>
              Mingle is designed to facilitate real-world meetings. While we take safety seriously and 
              provide tools like blocking and reporting, <strong class="text-white">you are responsible 
              for your own safety</strong> when meeting people in person.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">We recommend:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mt-4">
              <li>Meeting in public places</li>
              <li>Telling a friend where you'll be</li>
              <li>Trusting your instincts</li>
              <li>Reporting any suspicious behavior</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">7. Matches and Messages</h2>
            <p>
              Matches and conversations on Mingle expire after 24 hours by design. We are not responsible 
              for preserving match history or message content. The 10-message limit per match is a core 
              feature intended to encourage real-world interaction.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">8. Venue Check-ins</h2>
            <p>
              The venue check-in feature requires you to be physically present at participating venues. 
              Attempting to fake your location or check in from places you are not physically present 
              may result in account suspension or termination.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">9. Termination</h2>
            <p>
              We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time for violations of 
              these Terms or for any other reason at our discretion. You may delete your account at 
              any time through the App settings.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">10. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
            <p>
              THE APP IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND. WE DO NOT GUARANTEE THAT THE 
              APP WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, SECURE, OR ERROR-FREE. WE DO NOT VERIFY THE IDENTITY OR 
              BACKGROUND OF USERS.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">11. Limitation of Liability</h2>
            <p>
              TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, MINGLE SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, 
              INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE APP, 
              INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO DAMAGES ARISING FROM INTERACTIONS WITH OTHER USERS.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">12. Indemnification</h2>
            <p>
              You agree to indemnify and hold harmless Mingle and its officers, directors, employees, 
              and agents from any claims, damages, or expenses arising from your use of the App or 
              violation of these Terms.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">13. Changes to Terms</h2>
            <p>
              We may modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the App after changes constitutes 
              acceptance of the new Terms. We will notify you of significant changes through the App 
              or by email.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">14. Governing Law</h2>
            <p>
              These Terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia. Any disputes shall 
              be resolved in the courts of New South Wales.
            </p>
          </section>
          
          <section>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">15. Contact</h2>
            <p>
              For questions about these Terms, please contact us at:
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4">
              <a href="mailto:legal@getmingle.app" class="text-[var(--color-primary-light)] hover:underline">legal@getmingle.app</a>
            </p>
          </section>
          
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-[var(--color-dark-border)]">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--color-primary-light)] hover:underline">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer />
</Layout>

